{
  "type": "default",
  "id": "ad-versetzung-bestellung",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Versetzung im Active Directory · Transfer in Active Directory**\n\nDas Konto wechselt in die OU der neuen Organisationseinheit und erhält deren Gruppen; die Gruppen der bisherigen verliert es. · The account moves to the new unit's OU and gets its groups; it loses the groups of the previous one."
    },
    {
      "key": "konto",
      "type": "select",
      "label": "Konto · Account",
      "description": "Suche nach Name, Anmeldename oder Mail im Active Directory; übermittelt wird der Anmeldename (sAMAccountName). · Search the Active Directory by name, logon name or mail; the logon name (sAMAccountName) is submitted.",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "atlasDataSource": {
        "version": 1,
        "workerType": "ad",
        "worker": "ad_verzeichnis",
        "resource": "users",
        "searchFields": [
          "displayName",
          "givenName",
          "sn",
          "mail",
          "sAMAccountName"
        ],
        "option": {
          "label": "displayName",
          "description": "sAMAccountName",
          "details": [
            "department"
          ]
        },
        "pageSize": 25,
        "minSearchLength": 2
      }
    },
